	(text "Requirements: docs/requirements.md 4.1. Floorplan and parts: boards/can-controller/README.md.\nTwo domains: LOGIC (Pi ground, header 5 V, 3.3 V) and 12 V (CAN bus ground GND_BUS, from the DIN supply).\nOnly the isolators cross: ISO1044 (CAN), ISO6740 (relay drive), TLP293 (12 V status)."
